		{"id":"m_esp","type":"text","text":"**ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1** (Pin header)\nใช้ 21 GPIO · สำรอง 14, 47\nห้าม: 0, 3, 45, 46, 19, 20, 26–32, 35–37*, 43, 44, 38/48","x":840,"y":40,"width":420,"height":130,"color":"4"},
