		{"id":"i_dia","type":"file","file":"image/Diaphragm pump.png","x":2200,"y":280,"width":111,"height":110},
		{"id":"i_hum","type":"file","file":"image/Humidifier.png","x":2080,"y":840,"width":128,"height":110},
		{"id":"o_r1","type":"text","text":"**R1** ต้อง Active-HIGH / Jumper H/L = H\n**R2** Ch3 ใช้ NC (ไม่มีไฟ = ปั๊มลมทำงาน)\n**R9** เช็ค Relay ไม่กระพริบตอน Boot","x":1600,"y":710,"width":460,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"o_hum","type":"text","text":"**Humidifier** USB-C 5V มีปุ่ม\n**R3** ทดลองว่าจ่ายไฟแล้วพ่นเอง — ถ้าไม่ ใช้ Opto คร่อมปุ่ม S1","x":1600,"y":850,"width":460,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"o_rel","type":"text","text":"**Relay 4 ช่อง** (นอกบอร์ด, XH 6 ขา)\nCh1 Lamp RED 39 · Ch2 Lamp GREEN 40\nCh3 Air Pump 41 (**NC**) · Ch4 Humidifier 21 (NO)","x":1600,"y":570,"width":460,"height":120,"color":"6"},
